  "headline": "Fountain Of Life Faults Arrest Warrant Against Jimmy Odukoya",
  "seoTitle": "Fountain of Life Church Leadership Dispute",
  "metaDescription": "The Fountain of Life Church has challenged a bench warrant for Jimmy Odukoya, citing lack of legal service and outstanding motions in the ongoing dispute.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The church claims the arrest warrant for Jimmy Odukoya is invalid because he was not properly served with court papers.",
    "Legal representatives argue that pending applications were ignored before the warrant was issued, leading the presiding judge to recuse herself.",
    "The ongoing leadership dispute has drawn intervention from religious figures who have called for unity among congregation members."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Fountain of Life Church is currently experiencing a leadership crisis that has moved into the legal system. Jimmy Odukoya, who serves as a pastor at the church, has been at the center of contempt proceedings initiated by a church board. While authorities recently issued a bench warrant for his arrest due to his absence from court, church representatives have formally faulted the order. They contend that the legal process was flawed, asserting that Odukoya was never served with the necessary court documents and that several pending applications were not resolved before the warrant was issued. Consequently, the presiding judge in the matter has recused herself. Amid these tensions, other prominent religious leaders have publicly urged the congregation to remain united and avoid taking sides, while church leadership continues to publicly describe the organization as strong and unshakable despite the internal discord.",
